same scalar restricted-type bound.  This is the precise finite replacement
for the unavailable direct weak-one pairing estimate. -/
theorem scratch_finite_outputLayer_sum_le_card_mul
    {ι κ ξ ω : Type*} (s : Finset ι) (t : Finset κ) (u : Finset ξ)
    (L : Finset ω)
    (M : ι → κ → ξ → ℝ) (W : ω → ι → κ → ξ → ℝ)
    (P : ι → κ → ξ → ℝ)
